        "description_short": "The world’s noise, silenced at a touch.",
        "description_excerpt": "This is a logic - based line - drawing game tailor - made for \"obsessive - compulsive disorder sufferers\" and \"stress - relief enthusiasts\". We deeply understand that sometimes the best way to relax is to fully immerse yourself in a simple set of rules. Slide your fingertips to guide the flexible lines through the intricate grids, and experience the ultimate sense of healing when the colored blocks and lines fill the blanks in an instant.<br>Each level is an unfinished minimalist artwork. Watching the chaotic paths become orderly under your guidance, the sense of achievement is irreplaceable. This isn't an exam that requires painstaking thought, but a gentle mental exercise. Activate your spatial imagination with easy slides, allowing your brain to get a workout while resting. Here, there's no anxiety from a countdown, no endless battles, just you, the lines, and a pure geometric journey .",
